(2, 'destination', 2, 'vi', 'Thác Dray Nur | Dray Nur Waterfall | Một trong những thác nước hùng vĩ nhất Tây Nguyên. | One of the most majestic waterfalls in the Central Highlands. | Thác Dray Nur nằm trên dòng sông Sêrêpốk, là một trong những thác nước đẹp và hùng vĩ nhất khu vực Tây Nguyên, thích hợp cho trekking, chụp ảnh và tắm thác. | Dray Nur waterfall is breathtakingly beautiful with its massive curtain of water. You can explore the mysterious cave behind the waterfall and enjoy the pristine nature. | Huyện Krông Ana, Đắk Lắk | thiên nhiên,thác nước,trekking | giá low | rating 5.0', 'b73a230c67537ba03febfa21b5481aef3133c5f89e39910326ed475c2ebb46b0', 'gemini-embedding-2', '[-0.017378295,-0.061718903,0.028157666,0.00077243417,0.0066197957,0.0016773813,0.033336055,-0.041962113,0.023642523,-0.09373015,-0.023391964,-0.029381856,-0.033066016,-0.003969844,-0.04876481,0.0087250415,-0.015278295,0.025490496,-0.03131332,-0.002836583,0.037222665,-0.004230118,0.029732427,-0.023407973,-0.0050570173,0.017591063,-0.025340289,-0.0032030672,-0.035860427,0.24099803,-0.013587685,0.022839801,-0.0153541425,0.0022447198,0.009089114,0.020842802,-0.016219174,-0.03596779,0.0048862877,0.010161891,0.0049555176,-0.004643838,-0.0036730964,0.009295696,0.008274842,0.027046546,-0.041239645,0.026452618,-0.026697077,0.004055043,0.018934544,-0.019125786,0.022645192,-0.042793438,0.0033603131,0.06466917,-0.024146548,-0.012710234,0.048207764,0.0020324609,-0.024238447,0.050355595,-0.011369332,0.021309786,-0.032049168,0.0007935562,-0.023337293,-0.04960055,0.07009237,-0.009287775,0.011401718,0.006214055,0.037526075,0.005712994,0.0061659524,-0.007460094,0.009169325,-0.013313377,0.031404864,-0.034777664,-0.05103588,-0.04138759,-0.0018572172,-0.02022348,0.001159476,-0.016871465,0.010856101,-0.017082158,-0.07734054,0.0018899144,-0.055346545,0.04043493,-0.0041721333,-0.009178201,-0.020877572,0.062469028,0.039639365,-0.02724283,-0.004877965,0.0065000555,-0.0043550488,-0.005303095,-0.005142456,-0.040306274,