(4, 'destination', 4, 'vi', 'Buôn Đôn | Buon Don | Làng văn hoá nổi tiếng với nghề săn bắt và thuần dưỡng voi. | Famous for its elephant taming tradition and the suspension bridge over Serepok river. | Buôn Đôn là điểm đến văn hoá nổi tiếng của Đắk Lắk, nơi du khách tìm hiểu về nghề thuần dưỡng voi, tham quan nhà dài truyền thống, cầu treo và mộ vua voi Khunjunob. | Experience the wild nature, walk on the long suspension bridge, and learn about the unique culture of the local ethnic minorities. | Huyện Buôn Đôn, Đắk Lắk | văn hoá,voi,nhà dài,cầu treo | giá medium | rating 4.4', '717e926801f05a55f96671f22d0ef374cc917efa260b7607f973da5fe65d28d4', 'gemini-embedding-2', '[0.010966801,-0.031138714,-0.020934483,-0.045424055,-0.034225713,0.019183813,0.024523512,-0.013090456,-0.0036054277,-0.08028377,-0.03523777,-0.040613204,-0.012365666,0.013169691,-0.01702796,-0.01720485,-0.020849343,0.029208437,-0.031889353,0.009734269,0.05459015,-0.008676117,0.02990213,-0.025665717,0.004538868,-0.0010195929,-0.011598614,-0.020698693,-0.028043587,0.21818297,-0.02114593,-0.0077163423,0.004809459,0.010800436,0.029386966,0.005612951,0.0080318395,-0.05188533,-0.026960855,-0.0044374247,-0.00086156745,0.002667873,0.0073025953,0.03834243,0.010452317,0.006453371,-0.009119674,0.01880668,-0.021724831,0.033253454,0.03964325,-0.03287936,0.04599224,-0.050597426,-0.016012544,0.026386773,0.022141296,-0.024692802,0.038854886,-0.0171829,-0.010374431,0.012609413,-0.04026026,0.0094934255,-0.03502879,0.017251955,0.01791656,-0.032614484,0.060435858,-0.0069425954,-0.010750616,0.003432868,0.043969728,0.008809771,0.033648808,-0.014289122,-0.0127968965,-0.010528186,0.015590329,-0.024078358,-0.042430136,-4.0426537e-5,-0.021097975,-0.008367193,-0.0086572515,-0.012313617,0.035875417,0.001781438,-0.04390867,0.0038205462,-0.028425608,0.060719382,0.010050898,-0.005158351,0.012603442,0.046352267,0.020781253,-0.017080186,-0.020093592,0.020424929,-0.0160023,0.033183116,0.010110719,-0.06256218,-0.0036791423,0.00095751,0.0