(6, 'destination', 6, 'vi', 'Cà phê Buôn Ma Thuột | Buon Ma Thuot Coffee | Thủ phủ cà phê Việt Nam, trải nghiệm văn hoá cà phê đặc sắc. | The coffee capital of Vietnam, a great place to experience the culture of roasted coffee. | Buôn Ma Thuột được mệnh danh là \"thủ phủ cà phê\" của Việt Nam. Du khách có thể tham quan các đồn điền cà phê, Bảo tàng Thế giới Cà phê và thưởng thức cà phê nguyên chất Đắk Lắk. | A must-visit for coffee lovers. You can learn about the history of coffee, admire unique architecture, and taste premium coffee blends. | TP. Buôn Ma Thuột, Đắk Lắk | ẩm thực,cà phê,bảo tàng | giá free | rating 0.0', 'd7b1bbec4494e1057f9a4f3b045d4841440f9ba08154f4f2112a1070a1d79f90', 'gemini-embedding-2', '[0.010966522,-0.058683068,-0.0011121876,-0.037648648,-0.019503228,0.041563284,0.00018998068,-0.03118888,-0.006348333,-0.103335656,-0.019622168,-0.042762246,-0.0012259852,-0.003833897,-0.02878587,-0.038570456,-0.03549255,0.02994712,-0.02804012,0.027103068,0.0055663995,0.015843628,0.0273266,-0.0008080566,0.00590525,-0.011980706,0.025947222,-0.018863283,-0.038527012,0.2408945,-0.01918723,0.006207634,0.01922085,0.0133953765,-0.0035480796,0.024807245,-0.030849427,-0.021267343,-0.015095057,-0.017028425,-0.043911863,0.02112092,0.016350737,0.06648775,0.028985854,-0.015830481,-0.027136827,0.011153301,-0.0028529605,0.0075284177,0.024192812,-0.061100695,0.039509006,-0.038561355,0.02445396,0.032329824,0.026552714,0.014946228,0.019046852,-0.005999326,-0.029876437,-0.0048444197,-0.026211483,-0.007655479,-0.029055236,0.025880873,0.023463408,-0.016854756,0.024343893,0.006320887,0.009494806,-0.003452179,0.017035715,-0.021625198,0.024427872,-0.010706585,0.0064715715,-0.00062984775,0.03338762,-0.026291069,-0.0544629,-0.02504132,0.008097367,0.008635171,-0.029728742,0.03510427,0.014346424,0.015126755,-0.031604618,-0.029717864,-0.032643847,0.0205816,-0.024208529,-0.01618608,0.0102659315,0.02215342,0.050965667,-0.0033889557,-0.011345294,0.03413674,-0.022730961,0.013493258,0.02330929