(7, 'destination', 7, 'vi', 'Buôn Akô Dhông | Ako Dhong Village | Buôn làng Ê Đê đẹp nhất Buôn Ma Thuột. | A peaceful E De village in the heart of Buon Ma Thuot city. | Buôn Akô Dhông nằm ngay trong lòng thành phố Buôn Ma Thuột, nổi tiếng với những ngôi nhà dài truyền thống của người Ê Đê và không gian xanh yên bình. | Ako Dhong is known for its beautiful traditional longhouses, peaceful atmosphere, and the rich cultural heritage of the E De people. | TP. Buôn Ma Thuột, Đắk Lắk | văn hoá,nhà dài,Ê Đê | giá free | rating 4.3', '6977a55f8717d4626f83e14ce99cbcaa0242040d82076495a9da080d3973964f', 'gemini-embedding-2', '[-0.012225619,-0.037742626,-0.01726278,-0.06957256,-0.015564982,0.046700165,0.02773018,-0.01125214,-0.0034510745,-0.08092502,-0.0038084984,-0.025844904,-0.034625717,0.0015276638,-0.02066931,-0.026081739,-0.048896886,-0.0061453017,-0.0048025767,0.004597456,0.0342975,0.011028585,0.040817406,-0.023432195,0.013257787,-0.003055523,0.003108003,-0.0140152415,-0.035711415,0.23071878,-0.026804691,0.009710646,-0.008145544,-0.0077596274,0.033051327,0.038977318,-0.0029624375,-0.077024095,-0.02272023,-0.00418881,-0.029429365,-0.021078419,0.013508699,0.0475851,-0.0047262236,0.01852588,-0.033010215,0.020409258,-0.011395675,-0.00065373286,0.018188097,-0.07676052,0.024197126,-0.035728823,0.002880719,0.04056752,0.03607818,0.00029126194,0.053319078,0.032342475,-0.022604074,0.0005122662,-0.0031507236,0.009842345,-0.020224005,0.027635895,0.01887891,-0.02947562,0.036018495,0.0008652733,0.0055642556,0.012358477,0.03841888,-0.005473645,0.03882418,0.04731719,-0.016246261,-0.005427317,0.021944467,-0.012449651,-0.034071207,-0.029962678,0.010420756,-0.0101155415,-0.031068921,-0.0022604316,0.019540029,-0.0034244794,-0.026453976,-0.011460593,-0.018822504,0.06683158,-0.010383015,-0.0055190963,0.03680222,0.022806458,0.027210362,0.01042819,-0.021977032,-0.010614777,-0.0064925547,-0.0050040046,0.014907532,-0.07134859,-0.016807608,0.00055220764,-0.022560548,0.0023230712,0.0399103,0.0448069