(8, 'destination', 8, 'vi', 'Hồ Ea Kao | Ea Kao Lake | Hồ nước rộng lớn gần trung tâm thành phố, thích hợp cắm trại. | A serene lake surrounded by green forests, perfect for picnics and sunset watching. | Hồ Ea Kao là hồ nhân tạo rộng lớn nằm gần TP. Buôn Ma Thuột, không khí mát mẻ, phù hợp cho dã ngoại, cắm trại và chụp ảnh. | Ea Kao Lake is a great place to relax, enjoy the fresh air, and watch the beautiful sunset over the water. | TP. Buôn Ma Thuột, Đắk Lắk | thiên nhiên,hồ,cắm trại | giá free | rating 4.2', '0655aab9b2d4a7a57de101fc90a5aa32ada44f2db2873bf64df1774abd3811fa', 'gemini-embedding-2', '[-0.012471542,-0.046262696,-0.030574096,-0.042477094,-0.02806466,0.043024097,0.015814316,-0.03814031,-0.006052409,-0.09402322,0.0066858376,-0.016155958,-0.03354784,0.019019386,-0.040294316,-0.04356907,-0.02281104,-0.012127166,-5.83512e-5,0.003260342,0.025642045,-0.014099227,0.02449342,-0.042403463,-0.009210001,0.01145285,0.00015929627,0.0042520138,-0.068678156,0.25790358,-0.03805204,0.029689172,0.012825014,0.019450247,0.007559355,-0.0005213976,-0.027594773,-0.049704462,-0.018283207,-0.016622743,-0.038660962,-0.013962504,-0.009064295,0.029656926,0.0039862813,0.0039951927,-0.021851365,0.04130298,-0.0154285235,0.0067203525,0.025269136,-0.061027113,0.03146873,-0.026259046,0.0030157608,0.06311619,-0.012628394,-0.040116653,0.011740339,-0.021924492,-0.049959004,-0.0035280497,0.02264693,0.0029336142,-0.047136474,0.019490097,0.019974686,0.0005057007,0.055724025,0.0005075062,0.012399434,-0.0010585159,0.05585788,-0.0013496883,-0.019166192,-0.0065915226,0.0043937387,-0.015080459,0.023848746,-0.048298746,-0.045643553,-0.013884206,-0.0055843107,-0.004193954,-0.0373377,0.0069397455,0.0062895557,0.0020652977,-0.055270612,-0.0016501105,-0.012928657,0.019960176,-0.045167666,-0.008645123,0.01412069,0.0459587,0.027887434,0.0053216484,-0.033356838,0.002426569,-0.012370409,-0.00912593,0.00045571136,-0.04588162,-0.017135218,-0.023428967,-0.016831389,0.028121328,0.022174943,0.030022034,-0.000