(9, 'destination', 9, 'vi', 'Gành Đá Đĩa - Phú Yên | Ganh Da Dia - Phu Yen | Kiệt tác thiên nhiên với các khối đá hình lăng trụ xếp liền nhau. | A natural masterpiece with interlocking basalt columns. | Gành Đá Đĩa là một trong những danh thắng quốc gia đặc biệt của Phú Yên, thu hút đông đảo du khách bởi cấu tạo địa chất độc đáo. Các khối đá bazan hình lục giác, ngũ giác xếp chồng lên nhau như những chồng đĩa vươn ra biển. | Ganh Da Dia is a unique geological phenomenon in Vietnam. It looks like a giant black honeycomb rising from the sea, a must-visit destination in Phu Yen. | biển, thiên nhiên, phú yên, chụp ảnh | giá low | rating 4.5', '960cb8834dfb844fe437e0d5ced4e1c95f834f2dac483f670e487f1708f93fe1', 'gemini-embedding-2', '[-0.033378918,-0.03718966,-0.026618594,-0.011429405,0.017269576,0.011824448,0.00479121,-0.016938692,0.03758859,-0.12298618,0.011244519,0.010823813,-0.020480389,0.028030438,-0.035396025,-0.021644386,-0.002015189,0.006335442,-0.04646912,0.02023434,0.0102249095,0.0073288567,-0.018088438,0.01918316,0.023122754,-0.0051009348,-0.0050932146,0.006672412,-0.052723978,0.25041217,-0.006274954,-0.014557048,0.012571972,-0.0117395595,-0.020389467,0.0028680535,-0.047565352,-0.036227245,-0.011131792,-0.021985352,0.011023696,-0.0077620917,0.0056183995,0.02113145,-0.008874567,0.017218541,-0.060962494,0.07417363,-0.004907146,-0.0005762679,-0.00023869735,-0.030281685,0.019120237,-0.025238523,-0.00731866,0.016583268,-0.01643888,-0.015207095,0.035082128,0.025448859,-0.030369217,0.00014137189,0.01010133,-0.01207401,-0.00094054185,-0.015263787,-0.010565058,-0.02899742,0.040108625,0.04059087,0.005407435,0.020100847,-0.0035229535,-0.0136879515,-0.014168844,-0.02457328,0.012512071,-0.021641398,0.022914095,-0.0197619,-0.05458311,-0.017481754,0.03407159,-0.008985214,0.010900032,-0.014645899,0.02467123,0.034533665,-0.047606822,0.017455699,-0.012232487,-0.010354343,0.022767603,-0.020333828,-0.040743135,0.025877478,0.04829715,-0.011484518,-0.02630871,-0.010839292,-0.0401793