(10, 'destination', 10, 'vi', 'Đầm Ô Loan | O Loan Lagoon | Đầm nước lợ nổi tiếng với đặc sản sò huyết ngon nức tiếng. | A brackish lagoon famous for its delicious blood cockles. | Nằm yên bình dưới chân đèo Quán Cau, Đầm Ô Loan mang vẻ đẹp tĩnh lặng, thơ mộng. Nơi đây là điểm đến lý tưởng để ngắm hoàng hôn và thưởng thức hải sản tươi sống, đặc biệt là sò huyết. | O Loan Lagoon offers a peaceful scenery, especially at sunrise or sunset. Don\'t forget to try the famous seafood here, especially the blood cockles. | hải sản, thiên nhiên, phú yên, ẩm thực | giá medium | rating 4.5', 'ac30ccb20905a5d96679403943081c10544bd54a30d4b1ad5ae423bd3dce3e95', 'gemini-embedding-2', '[-0.015647596,-0.01437739,-0.02922524,-0.0068171076,-0.027912538,0.028069869,0.008062278,-0.021508723,0.03432989,-0.11017193,0.0072379396,0.007754274,-0.013546352,0.016196413,-0.027511442,-0.027424067,-0.012519542,-0.01605619,-0.035991464,-0.018627519,-0.02023258,0.0012035331,0.0021440857,0.0058941673,-0.00018953426,0.014050584,0.008035651,0.047019403,-0.039303057,0.24991737,-0.005241075,-0.014998189,0.024508504,0.037978686,0.0053535122,-0.015669685,-0.01350338,-0.020005856,-0.050851997,-0.00073343364,0.019613022,-0.008729126,0.020201694,0.036091417,-0.010446331,0.024150722,-0.0439548,0.044693165,-0.0058882916,0.01649723,0.0049072136,-0.04438819,0.0162335,0.011552867,0.013301661,0.03736255,-0.030706994,0.022425242,0.034022626,0.02270063,-0.027289895,-0.0111471,-0.0223317,-0.02652232,-0.037099663,-0.018294398,0.021141764,-0.007873742,0.025972623,0.03259878,0.012894712,0.01736642,0.027107466,-0.012238664,-0.013784556,-0.0038131538,0.017188013,-0.057619777,0.0027420234,-0.014876653,-0.052517056,-0.010788807,0.015955001,0.009090292,-0.022281833,-0.027130896,-0.009341608,0.05714046,-0.009429267,-0.024894068,-0.03379583,0.007842868,0.035733454,-0.03571915,-0.022634458,-0.0033000864,0.031167323,0.017510373,-0.059028946,-0.014731064,-0.012685327,-0.02196184,-0.036741253,-0.057842076,-0.00764605,-0.0024475902,-