(11, 'destination', 11, 'vi', 'Vịnh Vũng Rô | Vung Ro Bay | Vịnh biển xanh biếc, lịch sử hào hùng và hải sản phong phú. | A blue bay with a heroic history and abundant seafood. | Vũng Rô là một vịnh nhỏ thuộc xã Hòa Xuân Nam, huyện Đông Hòa. Nơi đây từng là bến đỗ của những con tàu Không số trong chiến tranh. Ngày nay, Vũng Rô níu chân du khách bởi làn nước trong xanh và các bè hải sản tươi ngon. | Vung Ro Bay is surrounded by high mountains. It was an important site for the Ho Chi Minh trail on the sea during the war, and now a beautiful spot for tourists. | biển, lịch sử, phú yên, hải sản | giá medium | rating 4.5', '382d0eb86687c7920ba8d2b98d18d1ece86dca9f3c911c56685de8cfbe0696ac', 'gemini-embedding-2', '[-0.03894278,-0.0119748125,-0.028394679,-0.008306714,-0.0029139922,0.036396414,0.017701054,0.00054757134,0.055049285,-0.11401072,-0.0044319076,0.018086683,-0.005746852,0.002078924,-0.019954631,-0.038657077,-0.025287112,-0.019527817,-0.021552075,0.019368239,-0.012821631,0.0037766374,0.007981606,-0.0034235616,-0.012692374,-0.00905301,0.009548885,0.0005047186,-0.060273137,0.23506269,-0.0041179503,-0.04319048,-0.00025265035,0.07680245,-0.0024425015,0.011971998,-0.020540753,-0.022720039,-0.03908165,0.003541326,0.0060660453,0.003512797,0.012669407,0.0024995105,-0.010942802,0.0027687065,-0.045576893,0.04399446,-0.011683836,0.024022378,-0.0035954914,-0.036752276,0.020202365,0.018537618,-0.012260462,0.05753698,-0.021230219,0.017090866,0.01793237,0.0052271835,-0.025416693,0.0066620973,0.014771223,-0.028129091,-0.021182556,-0.02846237,-0.0036678687,-0.027106063,0.008552929,0.016541919,0.001698906,0.006396414,0.013954434,-0.0042765024,-0.04091709,-0.034954842,0.032771293,-0.04643495,0.024633816,-0.015338078,-0.057059158,-0.00020408155,0.030207125,0.01924548,0.03798441,-0.015171752,0.00046827644,0.0361641,0.011802138,0.0005918121,-0.024526674,0.008889661,0.018266179,-0.0053851935,0.00771952,-0.0079933135,0.031682625,-0.0006773972,-0.06299404,-0.011707752,-0.005798866,0.000678