(12, 'destination', 12, 'vi', 'Bãi Môn - Mũi Điện | Bai Mon - Mui Dien | Nơi đón bình minh đầu tiên trên đất liền Việt Nam. | The easternmost point of Vietnam, welcoming the first sunrise. | Mũi Điện (Mũi Đại Lãnh) và Bãi Môn tạo nên một bức tranh tuyệt đẹp. Dưới chân ngọn hải đăng là bãi cát trắng mịn và làn nước trong vắt. Trải nghiệm cắm trại và đón những tia nắng đầu tiên là không thể bỏ lỡ. | Mui Dien Cape features a historic lighthouse and the beautiful, pristine Bai Mon beach. It is one of the places to catch the first rays of the sun in Vietnam. | biển, bình minh, thiên nhiên, phú yên | giá low | rating 4.5', '45cca7e083f24e9384fb4b0f2e610a68809df57e29ee96e38df2ae6b4451cbf4', 'gemini-embedding-2', '[-0.061542995,-0.02493152,-0.060407616,-0.015598559,0.0043226453,0.029965274,0.019418856,0.019847658,0.030402679,-0.11980203,0.033575907,0.016012844,-0.04331031,-0.006010379,-0.003759005,-0.024840256,-0.0058603142,-0.015036531,-0.020387549,0.028457802,0.014469088,0.0052266954,-0.005938818,-0.006304642,0.027161937,-0.0077441204,0.0054352167,-0.019389281,-0.0646211,0.22696431,0.0063620033,-0.034953456,0.009390563,0.020392649,-0.0025355383,0.023925675,-0.025127752,-0.02133821,-0.016830796,-0.010162142,-0.0061963084,0.024351414,0.015045922,0.004958451,0.018187946,-0.0137589285,-0.020135887,0.03316974,-0.013600654,0.027871486,0.0015860522,-0.027384758,0.025206525,0.0010203563,0.006013376,0.04444343,-0.016735418,-0.005181111,0.054349024,-0.01282517,-0.013921801,0.010557423,0.0012277697,-0.033264324,-0.01706783,0.006608193,0.014981921,-0.028575791,-0.0030937362,0.0007415439,-0.007438883,0.02398346,-0.0043175053,0.0161418,-0.009908925,-0.05171559,0.016250167,-0.05045773,0.022804994,-0.03047316,-0.067073986,-0.015844822,0.0048939735,0.034844432,-0.0032452852,-0.005066249,0.0066127437,0.009614542,-0.032193534,-0.0042707017,-0.017284447,0.016855668,0.033792835,-0.022933986,-0.02714321,0.018254608,0.03828013,-0.010536318,-0.047581542,0.011237706,-0.0041283243,-0.025626201,0.0