(13, 'destination', 13, 'vi', 'Tháp Nghinh Phong | Nghinh Phong Tower | Biểu tượng du lịch mới của thành phố Tuy Hòa, Phú Yên. | The new tourism symbol of Tuy Hoa city, Phu Yen. | Tháp Nghinh Phong được thiết kế lấy cảm hứng từ truyền thuyết Lạc Long Quân - Âu Cơ, mang kiến trúc độc đáo, là điểm check-in không thể bỏ qua khi đến Phú Yên. | Inspired by the legend of Lac Long Quan and Au Co, Nghinh Phong Tower features unique architecture and is a must-visit check-in spot when visiting Phu Yen. | Tuy Hòa, Phú Yên | giá free | rating 4.5', '21cdd245bc042a1431f9d82ebe3fa60d7226789724eb752b2a20040704fb8658', 'gemini-embedding-2', '[-0.032065127,-0.016327523,-0.031518117,-0.026568178,0.012940229,0.040059675,0.022371242,-0.040606383,0.0424914,-0.12559855,0.012611723,0.008381851,-0.016670221,-0.006549941,-0.000512846,-0.010469454,-0.01627887,-0.022132786,-0.021651257,0.019480018,-0.0002381463,0.014098357,0.028509611,-0.013721284,-0.0022078957,-0.012093467,0.0123594105,0.0029924528,-0.058959972,0.2475575,-0.016073633,-0.030135514,0.015785564,0.020283317,-0.022182118,0.02434026,-0.04720324,-0.036693882,-0.023468593,-0.021956116,0.025970913,0.007296024,-0.0032905517,0.0288558,-0.002142331,0.014595461,-0.042230513,0.04141129,-0.009395238,0.016423585,-0.013337542,-0.02500015,-0.0063302373,-0.030110456,0.017441792,0.016768279,-0.006976616,-0.0076950616,0.037082125,0.013352657,-0.038164288,-0.02569527,0.013455311,-0.011253756,0.008854291,-0.0027307437,-0.029730981,-0.030065546,-0.007872357,-0.015102079,0.011580193,0.0012975177,-0.012792024,-0.037895177,-0.042882673,-0.041128635,-0.008528021,-0.045219623,0.039764754,-0.022458155,-0.050035033,-0.019892398,0.022886347,-0.009023063,-0.016200904,-0.008424058,0.035043813,0.0055677984,-0.040644515,-0.00074888056,-0.015394476,0.023252029,0.024323095,-0.021611568,-0.0303832,0.027938148,0.04344913,-0.01302228,-0.031562176,0.020790152,-0.060306884,-0.05791212,-0.01837784,-0.040045,-0.011170613,-0.015318192,-0.007508738,0.0033379328,0.0358742