(14, 'destination', 14, 'vi', 'Hòn Yến | Hon Yen | Hòn đảo nhỏ với rạn san hô tuyệt đẹp lộ trên mặt nước lúc thủy triều rút. | A small island with beautiful coral reefs exposed at low tide. | Hòn Yến mang vẻ đẹp hoang sơ. Vào những ngày đầu hoặc giữa tháng âm lịch, khi thủy triều rút xuống, nơi đây để lộ ra những rạn san hô nhiều màu sắc vô cùng rực rỡ. | Hon Yen retains its pristine beauty. During the beginning or middle of the lunar month, the low tide reveals incredibly vibrant coral reefs. | Tuy An, Phú Yên | giá low | rating 4.5', '256a035d0b2e7c20eeaaf261733aa150a7884f01fa6db3dbd755df63cbd7d1e6', 'gemini-embedding-2', '[-0.06487822,-0.021333918,-0.02859492,-0.033183496,0.01351635,0.021930423,0.008677136,-0.0046487497,0.024476172,-0.13248923,0.01728244,-0.009614938,0.00840062,0.022744354,-0.03331943,-0.010123169,-0.010527469,-0.0038218854,-0.030672913,-0.011036335,-0.0067936834,-0.0046182396,-0.02062709,0.010047904,0.016600238,-0.0060775974,-0.01190577,0.019224508,-0.045372244,0.24720833,0.0030265967,-0.026852291,0.038857587,0.0024524454,-0.0066219177,-0.006430535,-0.03958496,-0.060583834,-0.011147465,-0.035914578,-0.0021503763,-0.018554902,-0.008692859,0.015307053,-0.0213706,0.026877444,-0.033934716,0.062835895,-0.0027096472,0.0004371984,-0.023103759,-0.016962765,0.011524156,-0.012888511,0.0073204427,0.014123113,-0.037977383,0.008683469,0.023869341,0.025408253,-0.050682984,-0.024577953,0.017250804,-0.032046206,-0.048803583,-0.011179556,0.011392605,-0.0007897068,0.05298958,0.04172066,-0.023497578,0.043856233,0.00033690818,-0.021644099,-0.029872596,-0.008244311,0.02686486,-0.026772568,0.021222528,1.4314304e-5,-0.07330856,-0.006500581,-0.0034426772,-0.001424419,-0.011948556,-0.03581212,0.017912658,0.019313019,-0.020132052,-0.015454707,-0.0345944,0.008862235,0.011337831,0.001592762,-0.021845108,-0.0019764442,0.0540572,0.0020533174,-0.06699332,-0.0019868123,-0.0021429919,-0.016478727,-0.007040093,-0.059538253,-0.002425096,-0.045104243,-0.00282133,-0.018054316,0.020