(15, 'destination', 15, 'vi', 'Thác Thủy Tiên | Thuy Tien Waterfall | Tuyệt tác thiên nhiên ba tầng giữa chốn đại ngàn Krông Năng. | A natural masterpiece with three levels in Krong Nang forest. | Thác Thủy Tiên (hay còn gọi là thác Ba Tầng) có không gian rộng lớn, hoang sơ và mát mẻ, phù hợp cho các chuyến dã ngoại, tắm suối và khám phá rừng núi. | Thuy Tien Waterfall (also known as Three-Level Waterfall) has a spacious, pristine, and cool environment, perfect for picnics, stream bathing, and forest exploration. | Krông Năng, Đắk Lắk | giá low | rating 5.0', '297b01f8861c950d22a48b044896b7a20945494768e152dfa4dc556968b521a1', 'gemini-embedding-2', '[-0.03848381,-0.04643638,-0.0030497867,-0.0096815815,0.014347258,0.002549995,0.0413549,-0.043644335,0.02132251,-0.102938764,-0.017852394,-0.031258587,-0.040455718,0.028587418,-0.014656235,-0.0011239232,-0.013094663,0.02326992,-0.015230976,0.0063208626,0.030952133,-0.022654984,0.014817283,-0.009010152,0.003136482,-0.0036411744,0.023373395,-0.0048284354,-0.04144057,0.23381367,-0.009999567,0.07149347,0.022252453,0.0042191492,-0.01262051,-0.016707566,-0.018005216,-0.04258865,-0.008256524,-0.00850033,-0.0063291774,-0.03734,0.01077356,-0.0062937113,0.014217698,0.030214608,-0.047491428,0.015639408,-0.027556127,0.017741814,0.028030321,-0.038330525,0.054259833,-0.023207767,-0.014686748,0.05599118,-0.022368139,-0.033945512,0.06241594,0.0043201167,-0.02772738,-0.014977226,0.00029992033,0.032035485,-0.03914788,-0.021036845,-0.0063218786,-0.032003306,0.058666088,0.039863322,0.0050410554,0.011182829,0.056240726,-0.0024033084,0.0062588444,-0.011430626,-0.013714798,-0.014745985,0.034618687,-0.031260796,-0.028739298,-0.009174208,-0.0027450367,-0.01365679,-0.010632524,-0.009085042,0.02641537,-0.021283256,-0.041732088,0.010391223,-0.020778285,0.020610353,-0.008461335,-0.009398128,0.0073657446,0.03744937,0.03598717,-0.025970548,-0.0120169725,-0.013806143,-0.016758692,0.022368178,-0.003892116,-0.072054595,0.0068633007,0.0019627304,-0.00136733